profile=Profile
profile.comment=LOW: 1024 shadow map, 80 block shadows, 4 shadow samples, sky-only reflections, flat water, no caustics or bloom. BALANCED: 2048 / 128 blocks / 8 samples, sky + cloud reflections, wave displacement, caustics, bloom. HIGH: 4096 / 192 blocks / 16 samples and screen-space reflections on water.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=For slow computers: smaller shadows, simple reflections, no bloom.
profile.BALANCED=Balanced
profile.BALANCED.comment=The intended look. Default.
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=Sharper and longer shadows, more shadow samples, screen-space reflections on water.

screen.WATER=Water
screen.WATER.comment=Waves, colour, reflections and foam of the sea.
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting
screen.LIGHTING.comment=Sun, sky, torch and lantern light, highlights.
screen.SHADOWS=Shadows
screen.SHADOWS.comment=Shadow map size, reach and softness.
screen.SKY=Sky
screen.SKY.comment=Clouds, distance haze and stars.
screen.MOTION=Motion
screen.MOTION.comment=Wind in leaves, plants and cloth.
screen.IMAGE=Image
screen.IMAGE.comment=Exposure, colour, bloom and the optional stylisation.

option.WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave Strength
option.WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Height of the swell and ripples. Pools and canals away from sea level always stay calmer.
option.WAVE_SPEED=Wave Speed
option.WAVE_SPEED.comment=How fast the waves travel.
option.WATER_DISPLACEMENT=Wave Geometry
option.WATER_DISPLACEMENT.comment=Moves the water surface up and down with the swell (a fraction of a block). Shadows follow the same motion.
option.WATER_TRANSPARENCY=Water Clarity
option.WATER_TRANSPARENCY.comment=How far you can see into the water before it turns deep blue.
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=How much the waves bend the view of what lies under the surface.
option.REFLECTION_QUALITY=Reflections
option.REFLECTION_QUALITY.comment=Sky: the sky gradient only. Sky + Clouds: also clouds, sun and moon. Screen Space: also nearby ships, docks and islands seen on screen.
value.REFLECTION_QUALITY.0=Sky
value.REFLECTION_QUALITY.1=Sky + Clouds
value.REFLECTION_QUALITY.2=Screen Space
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Steps
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Ray steps for screen-space reflections (only with Screen Space reflections).
option.FOAM_INTENSITY=Foam
option.FOAM_INTENSITY.comment=Foam along shores and around posts and hulls standing in the water; whitecaps in storms.
option.CAUSTICS=Caustics
option.CAUSTICS.comment=Moving light patterns on sunlit ground under water.
option.UNDERWATER_FOG=Underwater Fog
option.UNDERWATER_FOG.comment=Density of the water when you are under it.

option.SUN_STRENGTH=Sunlight
option.SUN_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of direct sun and moon light.
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH=Sky Light
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of the soft light from the sky (and of the sea light in the deep sea).
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH=Torch and Lantern Light
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of light from torches, lanterns and other light blocks.
option.MIN_LIGHT=Minimum Light
option.MIN_LIGHT.comment=Light that is always present so caves and closed rooms never go pitch black.
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH=Glow
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly lanterns, sea lanterns, glowstone, froglights, fire and lava glow.
option.SPECULAR_STRENGTH=Highlights
option.SPECULAR_STRENGTH.comment=Sun highlights and sky reflections on metal, glass, polished stone, roof tiles, wet ground and water.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT=Handheld Light
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT.comment=A torch or lantern in your hand lights up the area around you.

option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Size of the shadow map. Larger is sharper and slower.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far from you shadows are drawn (blocks). Beyond it, sky light decides what is lit.
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES=Shadow Samples
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=Filter samples per pixel for soft shadow edges.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Width of the soft shadow edge.
option.SHADOW_DISTORTION=Shadow Focus
option.SHADOW_DISTORTION.comment=How much shadow detail is concentrated near you.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilt of the sun's path. A tilt gives walls facing north and south light and shade.

option.CLOUD_MODE=Clouds
option.CLOUD_MODE.comment=Painted: soft drifting clouds drawn in the sky (and seen in water). Vanilla: the block clouds, restyled.
value.CLOUD_MODE.0=Off
value.CLOUD_MODE.1=Vanilla, restyled
value.CLOUD_MODE.2=Painted
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Cover
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=How much of the sky the painted clouds cover. Rain adds more.
option.HAZE_STRENGTH=Distance Haze
option.HAZE_STRENGTH.comment=Soft haze that blends distant islands into the horizon.
option.STARS=Stars

option.FOLIAGE_MOTION=Foliage Motion
option.FOLIAGE_MOTION.comment=Wind in leaves, grass, flowers, crops, vines and sea grass. Logs, planks and beams never move.
option.CLOTH_SWAY=Cloth Sway
option.CLOTH_SWAY.comment=Lets awnings and other hanging cloth from the mod's building kit move in the wind. Off by default.

option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Overall brightness. Interiors, caves and nights are opened up automatically.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Colour richness. Weak colours are lifted more than already vivid ones.
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=A glow around genuinely bright things: the sun, lanterns, fire, sparkles on water.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.STYLISATION=Stylisation
option.STYLISATION.comment=Gentle light banding and clean colour separation for a drawn look. Low by default.
option.OUTLINE_STRENGTH=Outlines
option.OUTLINE_STRENGTH.comment=Thin, faint darkening where depth jumps. Off by default.
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
